<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay's Jan-Aug cattle output up 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Paraguay's Jan-Aug cattle output up 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's cattle raising sector rose 6.5 percent in the January-August period from the same period a year ago, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The bank did not provide output figures, just percentage changes.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla Asuncion Newsroom 595 21 444527</p>
</text>
